    <cac:ProcurementProject xmlns="">
        <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">RFAPD for the provision of Enterprise AI Adoption and Capability Development Services divided into 4 Lots to Technology Ireland ICT Skillne</cbc:Name>
        <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">Technology Ireland ICT Skillnet intends to establish a Dynamic Purchasing System (DPS) comprising suitably qualified providers capable of delivering Enterprise AI Adoption and Capability Development Services. The purpose of the DPS is to provide Technology Ireland ICT Skillnet with a flexible mechanism through which specialist expertise can be engaged to support organisations in the planning, governance, adoption, deployment and operationalisation of Artificial Intelligence (AI). The DPS is not intended to procure specific AI software products, platforms or technology solutions. Rather, it is intended to provide access to expertise and support services that assist organisations in identifying opportunities, developing organisational capability, implementing appropriate governance arrangements, evaluating potential AI applications, deploying AI solutions and building long-term organisational readiness. Services commissioned under the DPS may vary depending on organisational requirements, sectoral context and levels of AI maturity. Support may be delivered through consultancy assignments, facilitated workshops, assessments, mentoring, capability-building initiatives, implementation guidance, peer-learning activities and other engagement approaches.</cbc:Description>
        <cbc:ProcurementTypeCode listName="contract-nature">services</cbc:ProcurementTypeCode>
        <cac:RequestedTenderTotal>
            <cbc:EstimatedOverallContractAmount currencyID="EUR">1200000</cbc:EstimatedOverallContractAmount>
        </cac:RequestedTenderTotal>
